# `dyn(...)` evaluated its payload through the exception-free evaluator, which
# SWALLOWS a throw: an unknown function inside `dyn(...)` left the payload with
# no ExprInfo and `yo check` passed the file with a hollow function body
# (issues/fixed/extern-declarations-are-not-forward-referenceable.md, face 2).
# `comptime_expect_error` cannot pin this — its propagate mode observes the
# swallowed throw — so the gate is `yo check` itself: rc=1 and the E0401.
stdout_keep_match=error\[E0401\]: Variable "totally_unknown_fn" not found\.
